# Root-only: the KataGo convention dir for user-downloaded nets. MUST stay
# anchored (leading slash) — an unanchored `models/` also matches, case-
# insensitively on macOS, the iOS `KataGo iOS/Models/` Swift group and
# `cpp/tests/models/`, silently hiding new source files from `git add`.
/models/
python/startposesupload.txt
for_release/

tests/results/matchsgfs/
